co/atencion-al-ciudadano/glosario/\", \"verification\": \"Fuente institucional y localizador revisados por el coordinador, 2026-09-09; año de edición no verificado.\", \"year\": null}, \"PUERTA1_RONDA3_CONSOLIDACION_20261024\": {\"citation\": \"Expediente Puerta 1 Ronda 3 Consolidación Pre-Puerta 2 (ANI / INVIAS / Uniandes, 2026-10-24)\", \"path\": \"_control_cambios/nutricion_capas_1_y_2_puerta1_20261023/\", \"title\": \"Censo documental exhaustivo y nutrición de las capas 1 y 2 de SITI\"}, \"QUDT21_UNITS_ARCHIVE\": {\"author\": \"Atribución individual no verificada en este lote\", \"blocks\": {\"HZ\": {\"block\": \"unit:HZ\\n  a qudt:DerivedCoherentUnit ;\\n  a qudt:DerivedUnit ;\\n  a qudt:Unit ;\\n  dcterms:description \\\"The hertz (symbol Hz) is the SI unit of frequency defined as the number of cycles per second of a periodic phenomenon. One of its most common uses is the description of the sine wave, particularly those used in radio and audio applications, such as the frequency of musical tones. The word \\\\\\\"hertz\\\\\\\" is named for Heinrich Rudolf Hertz, who was the first to conclusively prove the existence of electromagnetic waves.\\\"^^rdf:HTML ;\\n  qudt:conversionMultiplier \\\"1\\\"^^xsd:double ;\\n  qudt:conversionOffset \\\"0.0\\\"^^xsd:double ;\\n  qudt:dbpediaMatch \\\"http://dbpedia.org/resource/Hertz\\\"^^xsd:anyURI ;\\n  qudt:hasQuantityKind quantitykind:Frequency ;\\n  qudt:iec61360Code \\\"0112/2///62720#UAA170\\\" ;\\n  qudt:omUnit <http://www.ontology-of-units-of-measure.org/resource/om-2/hertz> ;\\n  qudt:symbol \\\"Hz\\\" ;\\n  qudt:ucumCaseInsensitiveCode \\\"HZ\\\" ;\\n  qudt:ucumCode \\\"HZ\\\" ;\\n  qudt:ucumCode \\\"Hz\\\" ;\\n  qudt:uneceCommonCode \\\"HTZ\\\" ;\\n  rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://qudt.org/2.1/vocab/unit> ;\\n  rdfs:label \\\"Hertz\\\" ;\\n.\", \"line\": 4950, \"uri\": \"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/HZ\"}, \"KiloM-PER-HR\": {\"block\": \"unit:KiloM-PER-HR\\n  a qudt:Unit ;\\n  dcterms:description \\\"\\\\\\\"Kilometer per Hour\\\\\\\" is a C.G.S System unit for  'Linear Velocity' expressed as \\\\\\\\(km/hr\\\\\\\\).\\\"^^rdf:HTML ;\\n  qudt:conversionMultiplier 0.2777777777777778e0 ;\\n  qudt:conversionOffset \\\"0.0\\\"^^xsd:double ;\\n  qudt:dbpediaMatch \\\"http://dbpedia.org/resource/Kilometres_per_hour\\\"^^xsd:anyURI ;\\n  qudt:expression \\\"km/hr\\\" ;\\n  qudt:hasQuantityKind quantitykind:LinearVelocity ;\\n  qudt:iec61360Code \\\"0112/2///62720#UAA638\\\" ;\\n  qudt:informativeReference \\\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kilometres_per_hour?oldid=487674812\\\"^^xsd:anyURI ;\\n  qudt:symbol \\\"km/hr\\\" ;\\n  qudt:ucumCaseInsensitiveCode \\\"KM.HR-1\\\" ;\\n  qudt:ucumCaseInsensitiveCode \\\"KM/HR\\\" ;\\n  qudt:ucumCaseSensitiveCode \\\"km.h-1\\\" ;\\n  qudt:ucumCaseSensitiveCode \\\"km/h\\\" ;\\n  qudt:ucumCode \\\"KM.HR-1\\\" ;\\n  qudt:ucumCode \\\"KM/HR\\\" ;\\n  qudt:ucumCode \\\"km.h-1\\\" ;\\n  qudt:ucumCode \\\"km/h\\\" ;\\n  qudt:uneceCommonCode \\\"KMH\\\" ;\\n  rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://qudt.org/2.1/vocab/unit> ;\\n  rdfs:label \\\"Kilometer per Hour\\\" ;\\n.\", \"line\": 6497, \"uri\": \"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/KiloM-PER-HR\"}, \"MilliM\": {\"block\": \"unit:MilliM\\n  a qudt:DerivedUnit ;\\n  a qudt:Unit ;\\n  qudt:conversionMultiplier \\\"0.001\\\"^^xsd:double ;\\n  qudt:conversionOffset \\\"0.0\\\"^^xsd:double ;\\n  qudt:dbpediaMatch \\\"http://dbpedia.org/resource/Millimetre\\\"^^xsd:anyURI ;\\n  qudt:expression \\\"mm\\\" ;\\n  qudt:hasQuantityKind quantitykind:Length ;\\n  qudt:iec61360Code \\\"0112/2///62720#UAA862\\\" ;\\n  qudt:informativeReference \\\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Millimetre?oldid=493032457\\\"^^xsd:anyURI ;\\n  qudt:symbol \\\"m^{-3}\\\" ;\\n  qudt:ucumCaseInsensitiveCode \\\"MM\\\" ;\\n  qudt:ucumCaseSensitiveCode \\\"mm\\\" ;\\n  qudt:ucumCode \\\"MM\\\" ;\\n  qudt:ucumCode \\\"mm\\\" ;\\n  qudt:uneceCommonCode \\\"MMT\\\" ;\\n  rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://qudt.org/2.1/vocab/unit> ;\\n  rdfs:label \\\"Millimeter\\\" ;\\n.\", \"line\": 9070, \"uri\": \"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/MilliM\"}, \"V\": {\"block\": \"unit:V\\n  a qudt:DerivedUnit ;\\n  a qudt:Unit ;\\n  dcterms:description \\\"<p><em>Volt</em> is the SI unit of electric potential. Separating electric charges creates potential energy, which can be measured in energy units such as joules. Electric potential is defined as the amount of potential energy present per unit of charge. Electric potential is measured in volts, with one volt representing a potential of one joule per coulomb of charge. The name of the unit honors the Italian scientist Count Alessandro Volta (1745-1827), the inventor of the first battery.  The volt also may be expressed with a variety of other units. For example, a volt is also equal to one watt per ampere (W/A) and one joule per ampere per second (J/A/s).</p>\\\"^^rdf:HTML ;\\n  qudt:conversionMultiplier 1.0e0 ;\\n  qudt:conversionOffset \\\"0.0\\\"^^xsd:double ;\\n  qudt:dbpediaMatch \\\"http://dbpedia.org/resource/Volt\\\"^^xsd:anyURI ;\\n  qudt:hasQuantityKind quantitykind:EnergyPerElectricCharge ;\\n  qudt:iec61360Code \\\"0112/2///62720#UAA296\\\" ;\\n  qudt:informativeReference \\\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Volt?oldid=494812083\\\"^^xsd:anyURI ;\\n  qudt:latexDefinition \\\"\\\\\\\\text{V}\\\\\\\\ \\\\\\\\equiv\\\\\\\\ \\\\\\\\text{volt}\\\\\\\\ \\\\\\\\equiv\\\\\\\\ \\\\\\\\frac{\\\\\\\\text{J}}{\\\\\\\\text{C}}\\\\\\\\ \\\\\\\\equiv\\\\\\\\ \\\\\\\\frac{\\\\\\\\text{joule}}{\\\\\\\\text{coulomb}}\\\\\\\\ \\\\\\\\equiv\\\\\\\\ \\\\\\\\frac{\\\\\\\\text{W.s}}{\\\\\\\\text{C}}\\\\\\\\ \\\\\\\\equiv\\\\\\\\ \\\\\\\\frac{\\\\\\\\text{watt.second}}{\\\\\\\\text{coulomb}}\\\\\\\\ \\\\\\\\equiv\\\\\\\\ \\\\\\\\frac{\\\\\\\\text{W}}{\\\\\\\\text{A}}\\\\\\\\ \\\\\\\\equiv\\\\\\\\ \\\\\\\\frac{\\\\\\\\text{watt}}{\\\\\\\\text{amp}}\\\" ;\\n  qudt:omUnit <http://www.ontology-of-units-of-measure.org/resource/om-2/volt> ;\\n  qudt:siUnitsExpression \\\"W/A\\\" ;\\n  qudt:symbol \\\"V\\\" ;\\n  qudt:ucumCaseInsensitiveCode \\\"V\\\" ;\\n  qudt:ucumCode \\\"V\\\" ;\\n  qudt:uneceCommonCode \\\"VLT\\\" ;\\n  rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://qudt.org/2.1/vocab/unit> ;\\n  rdfs:label \\\"Volt\\\" ;\\n.\", \"line\": 12851, \"uri\": \"http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/V\"}}, \"locator\": \"Sujetos unit:V, unit:HZ, unit:KiloM-PER-HR y unit:MilliM\", \"path\": \"Biblioteca_ontologias_transporte/20260908/analisis/fuentes_extraidas/RaCoOn/source_3e094ca07d4a5a520684b5ddcdbe6c0f7525ecc7/racoon/other/lib/unit.ttl\", \"publisher\": \"QUDT, copia distribuida en el repositorio RaCoOn\", \"sha256\": \"6fe92af489b767dda2ee39a443fe0c6b7f63322ae85480bdcac37bf826cb394a\", \"verification\": \"Lectura local directa; no consulta actual de qudt.org ni validación integral de sus conversiones. MilliM conserva un símbolo anómalo m^{-3} en esta copia; no se usa ni se corrige ese símbolo.\", \"version\": \"2.1, archivo local conservado\", \"year\": null}, \"SENA_ZOMAC_COMPILADO\": {\"artifacts\": [{\"bytes\": 710302, \"name\": \"zomac_anexo_compilado_sena.html\", \"sha256\": \"a81d66611ea5c4e89ac3d97ea227db12350abb3713cf6a77e527bef0f36b4edc\"}], \"consulted_date\": \"2026-10-05\", \"coverage\": \"corroboration_complete_list\", \"locator\": \"Decreto1625 compilado, Anexo2\", \"publisher\": \"SENA / Presidencia\", \"title\": \"Anexo2 ZOMAC compilado\", \"url\": \"https://normograma.sena.edu.co/compilacion/docs/decreto_1625_2016_pr049.htm\"}, \"SITI_ANI_PLANEACION_20261005\": {\"author\": \"Fuentes recibidas del jurado; autor individual y fecha del snapshot no comprobados\", \"locator\": \"documentacion_trazabilidad/PLANEACION_ANI_POWERBI_20261005.md\", \"source_kind\": \"reviewed_modeling_decision\", \"source_sha256s\": [\"77ea26b23b5e658fa2617f57eea52ed6456b073746b6fe59f69b1062dcde8ab9\", \"b0439b8cbce43982128467201ee99c2d8e617a62112731c9e7e154956f512568\", \"9e6db95bb22cd44245ed000de72e48dda201c28b27ea3dde2d47484af499511a\"], \"title\": \"Extensión de propiedades de planeación ANI a partir de tres PBIX recibidos y revisión SITI\"}, \"SITI_CONDICIONES_TERRITORIALES\": {\"author\": \"Juan Carlos Gómez Roldán; diseño propio SITI\", \"kind\": \"instrucción del investigador y diseño de contratos\", \"locator\": \"Tres atributos B50, fuentes y temporalidad; no clasificación excluyente\", \"path\": \"documentacion_trazabilidad/CONDICIONES_MUNICIPALES_20261005.md\", \"year\": 2026}, \"SITI_MAESTRO_20260911_4\": {\"author\": \"Juan Carlos Gómez Roldán\", \"kind\": \"Regla interna de clasificación\", \"locator\": \"revisión 2026-09-11.4; A/B, tabla B50 y padres taxonómicos\", \"path\": \"SITI_REGLAS_MAESTRAS_ONTOLOGIA.md\", \"sha256\": \"605c95b0e9b572f59b325f06be37e57003829d43699beb3adb1d8967f84fc0ab\", \"year\": 2026}, \"SITI_OETR_TRAFICO_20260911\": {\"author\": \"Autoría declarada en código: Juan Carlos Gómez Roldán y Consejo Científico SITI; no verificación de participantes\", \"kind\": \"Uso y definición interna observados; no fuente normativa externa\", \"locator\": \"OETR_CANONICAL_COLUMNS[Trafico], líneas 148–154\", \"path\": \"Fase_Activa/SITI/capa3_data_layer/siti_oetr_column_dictionary.py\", \"sha256\": \"9af9964a1aea7044d5685d372e20cece9421ab8ee1d2b5838cf020530ca35f06\", \"year\": 2026}, \"SITI_REGLA_DESACOPLAMIENTO_20260909\": {\"author\": \"Juan Carlos Gómez Roldán\", \"kind\": \"instrucción de diseño interno\", \"locator\": \"Invariante vigente de desacoplamiento taxonómico; decisión de objeto/material del 9 de septiembre\", \"path\": \"documentacion_trazabilidad/CORRECCION_OBJETO_MATERIAL_20260909.md\", \"year\": 2026}}" .

